---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Thesis Video Series | Danish West Indies"
	description="Watch our master thesis video series on the economic history of the Danish West Indies. Featuring Anton Meier Ebsen Jørgensen."
>
	<div class="page-container animate-fade-in">
		<header class="video-header">
			<a href="/thesis" class="back-link">← Back to Thesis Portal</a>
			<span class="label">Academic Portal</span>
			<h1>Thesis Video Series</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Exploring the Economic History of the Danish West Indies</p>
			
			<div class="promotional-links">
				<p>Presented by the authors. For more historical economics content, connect with Anton:</p>
				<div class="link-buttons">
					<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@thewanderingeconomist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo youtube">
						<span class="icon">▶</span> Subscribe on YouTube
					</a>
					<a href="https://www.antonebsen.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo website">
						<span class="icon">🌐</span> Visit AntonEbsen.dk
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="episodes-stack">
			
			<!-- EPISODE 1 -->
			<article class="episode-block">
				<div class="media-data-row">
					
					<!-- Left: Video Player -->
					<div class="video-column">
						<div class="video-wrapper placeholder-wrapper">
							<!-- Replace the div below with your YouTube iframe -->
							<div class="video-placeholder">
								<span class="recording-icon">🔴</span>
								<span>Recording in Progress</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Right: Title & Data Widget -->
					<div class="data-column">
						<span class="episode-tag">Episode 1</span>
						<h2>The Colonial Ledger: Data and Erasure</h2>
						<p class="episode-desc">An introduction to our thesis methodology. How did the Danish bureaucracy reduce human lives to taxable assets, and how can we resurrect those identities through quantitative analysis?</p>
						
						<!-- Featured Data Widget Placeholder -->
						<div class="data-widget">
							<h4>Featured Data: Estate La Grange (1803)</h4>
							<table class="mini-data-table">
								<tr><th>Category</th><th>Count</th><th>Value (Rdl)</th></tr>
								<tr><td>Capable Men</td><td>42</td><td>12,600</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Capable Women</td><td>38</td><td>9,500</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Children</td><td>15</td><td>1,500</td></tr>
								<tr><td class="highlight">Total Human Capital</td><td>95</td><td class="highlight">23,600</td></tr>
							</table>
							<span class="widget-note">*Sample data from the Matrikel</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Bottom: Show Notes & Downloads -->
				<div class="academic-notes-row">
					<div class="show-notes">
						<h3>Academic Show Notes</h3>
						<ul class="timestamp-list">
							<li><span class="time">00:00</span> - Introduction to the Colonial Archives.</li>
							<li><span class="time">05:22</span> - How African names were erased. Read more in <a href="/history/the-colonial-ledger">The Colonial Ledger as an Instrument of Power</a>.</li>
							<li><span class="time">12:15</span> - Introduction to the <a href="/thesis/data-explorer">Data Explorer</a> and methodology.</li>
							<li><span class="time">18:40</span> - Case Study: Exploring the <a href="/memorial">Memorial Register</a>.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="downloads-section">
						<h3>Supplemental Resources</h3>
						<div class="download-buttons">
							<a href="#" class="btn-download">
								<span class="icon">📄</span> Slide Deck (PDF)
							</a>
							<a href="/thesis/behind-the-code" class="btn-download">
								<span class="icon">💻</span> View Python Extraction Script
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- EPISODE 2 -->
			<article class="episode-block">
				<div class="media-data-row">
					<div class="video-column">
						<div class="video-wrapper placeholder-wrapper">
							<div class="video-placeholder">
								<span class="recording-icon">🔴</span>
								<span>Recording in Progress</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="data-column">
						<span class="episode-tag">Episode 2</span>
						<h2>The Sugar Beet Threat</h2>
						<p class="episode-desc">Analyzing the collapse of the Caribbean sugar economy. How European subsidized sugar beets permanently altered the profitability of the Danish West Indies.</p>
						
						<div class="data-widget">
							<h4>Featured Data: Sugar Price Collapse (1840-1880)</h4>
							<div class="mock-chart">
								<!-- Simple CSS Mock Chart -->
								<div class="bar-group"><div class="bar" style="height: 100%; background: #c4a77d;"></div><span>1840</span></div>
								<div class="bar-group"><div class="bar" style="height: 80%; background: #c4a77d;"></div><span>1850</span></div>
								<div class="bar-group"><div class="bar" style="height: 40%; background: #c4a77d;"></div><span>1860</span></div>
								<div class="bar-group"><div class="bar" style="height: 15%; background: #c4a77d;"></div><span>1870</span></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="academic-notes-row">
					<div class="show-notes">
						<h3>Academic Show Notes</h3>
						<ul class="timestamp-list">
							<li><span class="time">00:00</span> - The Golden Age of Cane Sugar.</li>
							<li><span class="time">08:45</span> - The rise of the European Beet. See <a href="/history/sugar-beet-threat">The Sugar Beet Threat</a>.</li>
							<li><span class="time">15:30</span> - Econometric analysis of the 1878 crash.</li>
							<li><span class="time">22:10</span> - Connection to the <a href="/history/1878-fireburn-st-croix">1878 Fireburn Labor Riot</a>.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="downloads-section">
						<h3>Supplemental Resources</h3>
						<div class="download-buttons">
							<a href="#" class="btn-download">
								<span class="icon">📄</span> Slide Deck (PDF)
							</a>
							<a href="/thesis/behind-the-code" class="btn-download">
								<span class="icon">📊</span> View Regression Model Data
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>

		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	/* Header Styles */
	.video-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
		position: relative;
	}

	.back-link {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: color var(--transition-fast);
	}

	.back-link:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }

	.label {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.video-header h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	/* Promotional Links */
	.promotional-links {
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: var(--space-lg);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.promotional-links p {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.link-buttons {
		display: flex;
		gap: var(--space-md);
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn-promo {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: bold;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.youtube { background-color: #FF0000; color: #FFF; }
	.youtube:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3); }
	
	.website { background-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg); }
	.website:hover { background-color: #d6b88a; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.3); }


	/* EPISODE STACK LAYOUT */
	.episodes-stack {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	.episode-block {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 12px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
	}

	/* Media & Data Row */
	.media-data-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1.2fr;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.video-column {
		padding: var(--space-lg);
		background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
	}

	.video-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 */
		background: #000;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
	}

	.video-wrapper iframe, .video-placeholder {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
		border: none;
	}

	.video-placeholder {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.recording-icon {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		animation: pulse 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }

	.data-column {
		padding: var(--space-lg);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.episode-tag {
		align-self: flex-start;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 3px;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.data-column h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.episode-desc {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
	}

	/* Featured Data Widget */
	.data-widget {
		background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: var(--space-md);
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.data-widget h4 {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
	}

	.mini-data-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.mini-data-table th, .mini-data-table td {
		text-align: left;
		padding: 0.3rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
	}

	.mini-data-table th { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-weight: normal; }
	.mini-data-table .highlight { color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: bold; }
	.widget-note { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-style: italic; }

	/* Mock Chart Widget */
	.mock-chart {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		justify-content: space-between;
		height: 100px;
		padding-top: 1rem;
	}

	.bar-group {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		height: 100%;
		width: 20%;
	}

	.bar {
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0;
		transition: height 1s ease;
	}

	.bar-group span {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		margin-top: 0.3rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	/* Academic Notes & Downloads Row */
	.academic-notes-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
	}

	.show-notes, .downloads-section {
		padding: var(--space-lg);
	}

	.academic-notes-row h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
	}

	.timestamp-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.timestamp-list li {
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.time {
		font-family: monospace;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
		border-radius: 3px;
		margin-right: 0.5rem;
	}

	.timestamp-list a {
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-accent);
		transition: color var(--transition-fast);
	}
	
	.timestamp-list a:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }

	.downloads-section {
		border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.download-buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.8rem;
	}

	.btn-download {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
		background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.btn-download:hover {
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	/* Responsive Design */
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.media-data-row, .academic-notes-row {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		
		.video-column { padding-bottom: 0; }
		
		.downloads-section {
			border-left: none;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		}
	}
	
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.back-link {
			position: static;
			display: block;
			margin-bottom: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
